2026-09-05 10:45:31 IST | INFO     | nsflow:_log:823 - nsflow: {"type": "AI", "text": "I can tell you all about the legendary band **Devo**! \n\nI can break down their theory of \"de-evolution,\" the story behind their 1978 debut album *Q: Are We Not Men? A: We Are Devo!* (produced by Brian Eno), and how they became pioneers of the New Wave movement. I can also dive into the technical side of their sound, like their use of early synthesizers and the mechanical rhythms that influenced everyone from Nirvana to LCD Soundsystem.\n\nI can also:\n* Recommend the best starting point for any classic rock or pop discography.\n* Share the history and \"lore\" behind famous recording sessions.\n* Explain the influences and lyrical meanings of songs from the 60s to today.\n* Find hidden gems and deep cuts you might have missed.\n\nAre you interested in Devo's early Ohio punk years or their 80s synth-pop era?"}
